OL,3,AEarly release scheme prisoner jailed
OL,4,Adays after leaving
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for a number of
OL,7,Fshoplifting offences days after being
OL,8,Ffreed under the government's early
OL,9,Frelease scheme.
OL,11,FMichael Bogle, 38, was released from
OL,12,FHMP Wandsworth on 1 October as part of
OL,13,Fthe first wave of prisoners to be let
OL,14,Fout under the plan.
OL,16,FSpeaking to reporters outside the
OL,17,Fprison following his release, Bogle
OL,18,Fsaid the conditions inside were "awful"
OL,19,Fand said "people like me" should not be
OL,20,Fin prison "for a long time".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
