OL,4,Adays after leaving
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the four days after his release,
OL,7,FBogle stole more than #100 worth of
OL,8,Fdetergent from supermarkets in north
OL,9,FLondon.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
