OL,3,ATrump announces deal for Russian diesel
OL,4,Aas Zelensky calls it a gift to Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's President Volodymr Zelensky
OL,7,Fhas condemned Donald Trump's
OL,8,Fannouncement of a deal to import
OL,9,FRussian diesel into the US.
OL,11,FZelensky called it a gift to Russian
OL,12,FPresident Vladimir Putin that amounts
OL,13,Fto "an investment in a war that must be
OL,14,Fended, not prolonged".
OL,16,FTrump said Putin had agreed to release
OL,17,F300,000 tonnes of diesel immediately
OL,18,F"to the American and global
OL,19,Fmarketplace" followed by 500,000 tonnes
OL,20,Fin November and another million after
OL,21,Fthat.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
